    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a68964ec35c618674dda8351",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们已经不再需要更多话语来表达心意了。\r\n时至今日，只需要看向对方的双眼——\r\n就能将对方想要传达的心意明白个大概。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2977a11f90d1b677b78efd8fa776bb21b0b6fa9d86d7c6fab837d131a5064de3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
