    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83b80797646e3dfc12a54900",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也正是因为我们的这份情谊，\r\n我们才能跨越那令人绝望的“GATE”。\r\n完全的，二人一体。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf8bfa8ff0809c77ace2217e82b7c3d08694940e871b9dd3299532946a1f615a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
